                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>At the 206th meeting of the National Security Council, July 15, in Washington,
                    the Council devoted a substantial amount of time to a report by the Secretary of
                    State on his talks in Paris with Premier Mendès-France and Foreign Secretary Eden and to the decision that Under Secretary Smith would return to the Geneva Conference as
                    Head of the United States Delegation.</p>
                <p>For a memorandum of discussion of this meeting, see <ref
                        target="frus:frus1952-54v13p1">volume XIII</ref>.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
